sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2008, 2011) & Theveneau et al. (2013) neural crest CIL, C3a co-attraction & Sdf1 chase-and-run migration — MorphoEval overall 55.0/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py` (57.6/100). The v1 baseline simulates a single 2D neural crest chaser cluster and epibranchial placode runner cluster under Contact Inhibition of Locomotion (CIL), C3a/C3aR co-attraction (COA), and Sdf1 chemotaxis alongside a placode-ablated negative control, but omits the remaining three experimental perturbation regimes of Theveneau et al. (2013) (C3aR-MO COA ablation, N-cadherin/DshDep+ CIL blockade, and stationary Sdf1 bead control), does not simulate the three-stream pharyngeal pouch architecture (r4, r6, r7 streams targeting e1, e2, e3 placodes), does not load or segment the vendored embryonic neural crest specimen (`neural_crest_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 55.0/100 (faithfulness 50.0, reproducibility 66.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 68, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 47, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/neural_crest_chase_and_run_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-carmona-neural-crest-chase-and-run.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 78344 B, 1680×560 px, artifact_sha256 55d7a1f67cc098a34e92b7657cfc44157567d6da4916257e112122b979682c46 (sha256 55d7a1f67cc098a34e92b7657cfc44157567d6da4916257e112122b979682c46), spec_fingerprint eaab4129b9e5439c62a3183cca6415d43a158fd3cba206648d80e37937887881. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: eaab4129b9e5439c62a3183cca6415d43a158fd3cba206648d80e37937887881; artifact_sha256: 55d7a1f67cc098a34e92b7657cfc44157567d6da4916257e112122b979682c46." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/neural_crest_chase_and_run/neural_crest_chase_and_run_reference.json` and `neural_crest_specimen.jpg`, segment the 3 blue neural crest streams (`r4`, `r6`, `r7`), 3 orange epibranchial placodes (`e1`, `e2`, `e3`), and green pharyngeal pouches in Control Panel A vs BMPR-inhibited Panel C, and quantify dorsoventral chaser-runner separation, stream spacing CV, and dorsoventral density profile correlation.",
            "remediation needed: Simulate all 5 experimental regimes of Theveneau et al. (2013) & Carmona-Fontaine et al. (2011) (`wildtype_chase_and_run`, `placode_ablated_no_sdf1`, `c3ar_morpholino_no_coa`, `ncad_dshdep_no_cil`, and `stationary_sdf1_bead`), plus a 3-stream pharyngeal arch simulation (`r4`, `r6`, `r7` neural crest streams chasing `e1`, `e2`, `e3` epibranchial placodes between pharyngeal pouches `p1`, `p2`) and a continuous 2D `(k_COA, chi_Sdf1)` parameter sweep.",
            "remediation needed: Validate the 5-regime Forward Migration Index (`FMI`) and 6-hour collective displacement hierarchy against Theveneau et al. (2013) empirical measurements (Pearson r, RMSE), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-anchored metrics, and expose full CLI flags." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.55"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

